  "instructions": [
    "Bring a pot of salted water to a boil and add the olive oil.",
    "Add the collard greens and blanch for 1 minute, then transfer to ice water to stop cooking.",
    "Drain the greens and pat dry with a towel.",
    "In a small bowl whisk together Greek yogurt, Dijon mustard, lemon juice, minced garlic, salt and pepper.",
    "Toss the blanched collards with the dressing until evenly coated.",
    "Stir in chopped walnuts and diced dill pickle until well distributed.",
    "Serve immediately or chill for 15 minutes before serving."
